### Notifications (Toast)

**Configuration:**
```tsx
<Toaster 
  position="top-right" 
  richColors 
  closeButton
  duration={6000}
/>
```

**Usage:**
```tsx
// Success
toast.success("Message", { duration: 6000 })

// Warning
toast.warning("Message", { duration: 7000 })

// Error
toast.error("Message", { duration: 7000 })

// With description
toast.warning("Title", {
  description: "Details here",
  duration: 8000
})

// With rich content
toast.warning(
  <div>
    <p className="font-medium mb-1">Title</p>
    <ul className="text-sm space-y-0.5">
      <li>• Item 1</li>
      <li>• Item 2</li>
    </ul>
  </div>,
  { duration: 8000 }
)
```

**Duration Guidelines:**
- Simple message: 5-6 seconds
- List/complex: 7-8 seconds
- Always include close button

